    "No first-pass or clearance data for the query."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L4 adds only related-diuretic low-permeability/solubility records and no furosemide-specific F or threshold-relevant absorption evidence; low permeability alone is insufficient to establish F<20%, especially given salicylic acid low PAMPA with high F. Transferable high-F contexts, including a fed-state F=95.3%, continue to support F>=20%. Prediction remains high with moderate confidence."
}

